cação, negociacação, foco em resultados, liderança e gestão de recursos e pessoas.&nbsp;</font></li><li data-section-id=\"liwvci\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2202\" fr-original-style=\"\" style=\"user-select: inherit; scrollbar-color: auto;\"><font color=\"#311873\">Atuação 100% presencial, com disponibilidade para viagens ocasionais.&nbsp;</font></li></ul>', 'comercial', 'coordenador', 'Ensino superior', NULL, 'efetivo', NULL, NULL, 'desabilitada', '42-coordenador-de-administracao-de-vendas', '2026-04-09 15:09:45', '2026-06-04 20:54:21'),
(43, 'Estágio em RH', 'PE', 'Recife', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Estagiário(a) de Recursos Humanos</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nosso cliente é uma empresa de consultoria de gestão de pessoas que atua hibridamente com projetos de seleção, clima, diagnóstico, desenvolvimento e cultura organizacional.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Quem pode se candidatar:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Estudante técnico em Adm/RH ou graduação em áreas correlatas.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Requisitos:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Habilidade de comunicação, trabalho em equipe, proatividade, dinamismo e interesse em aprender</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#374151;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Habilidade com informática, para o manuseio de plataformas de gestão de compartilhamento de dados online pelo drive e métodos ágeis.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">O que você vai fazer:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• atendimento, abordagem e agendamento de candidatos, além de triagem de currículos, confecção de formulários,&nbsp; participações em seleções, treinamentos, pesquisas nas visitas a clientes.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Oferecemos:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Bolsa estágio</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Ajuda de custo (transporte)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Seguro de vida</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Day Off</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-698c5691-7fff-791a-52b7-6913e9373a38\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1d3e66;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Plano de carreira</span></p>', 'recursos-humanos', 'estagiario', 'Nível Técnico', 'Menos de 1 ano', 'estagio', 'Parcial Tarde', NULL, 'desabilitada', '43-estagio-em-rh', '2026-04-28 10:58:35', '2026-05-28 13:58:41');
