(44, 'Coordenação de Planejamento e Orçamento', 'PE', 'Recife', '<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Empresa de grande porte busca profissional para Coordenação com a missão de assegurar o cumprimento de todas as exigências legais que regulam os processos de Planejamento Estratégico, orçamento e gestão institucional.</font></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font color=\"#083139\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) none 0px; font-weight: 600;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Responsabilidades:</font></span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Coordenar o desempenho do time, acompanhando indicadores, metas e resultados;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Propor planos de ação de melhoria e desenvolvimento organizacional;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Liderar a elaboração e o monitoramento do orçamento, programas de trabalho e relatórios gerenciais com gestores das áreas;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Desenvolver estudos, análises e pareceres técnicos para apoio à tomada de decisão da Diretoria;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Promover a padronização, revisão e otimização de processos, metodologias e ferramentas de gestão;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Atuar em projetos estratégicos, inovação e desenvolvimento de soluções que fortaleçam a eficiência organizacional;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Assessorar a gestão na implementação de práticas voltadas à qualidade, planejamento e desempenho institucional;</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); vertical-align: baseline; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style-type: none;\"><font color=\"#083139\">Apoiar auditorias com informações do plano de orçamento e estratégias da empresa.</font></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font color=\"#083139\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\